# --- Content packs: safety model from DESIGN_DOC §1.3 ---
# Everything under packs/ is ignored by default; ONLY the public pack is
# whitelisted. Local (BYOC) packs never reach git. Add each new public pack
# here explicitly — never loosen this to a name pattern.
packs/*
!packs/dev-english-a2/
